+- All three explicit non-flags, including "work the change explicitly defers is not missing". Without it a PR saying "follow-up in #500" gets that requirement reported absent, which is High, which is BLOCK.
+- The scope-creep negative list: refactors in passing, added tests, comments, and formatting are not scope creep.
